  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intensifying HIV Prevention in Zambia Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To prevent HIV infections and unwanted pregnancies by providing couples and women with integrated HIV and family planning counselling services. This will benefit 168,000 couples and 83,000 women by improving reproductive health.  This contributes towards Millennium Development Goal 6 by averting of 11,600 adult HIV infections, 2,300 perinatal HIV infections and 100,000 unwanted pregnancies by the end of 2016. (Nutsen)</narrative>
  </description>
